  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.135` to `4.1.136`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.135...application_builder_helpers/4.1.136)\n\n## What's Changed\n* chore: bump template dependencies (SDK 10.0.401, lib 4.1.134, .NET 10.0.12) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/403\n* fix(cli): unify thin validation model with canonical option grouping by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/406\n* fix(templates): remove hardcoded sampleapp binary names (rename-safe host discovery + Blazor initializer) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/407\n* fix(cli): unify help/version flag precedence post-resolution by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/408\n* fix(templates): remove EnsureBlazorJsInitializerName build-time shim by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/409\n* chore: remove redundant project skills, harness owns them by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/410\n* chore(skills): setup matt-pocock issue-tracker and domain docs by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/411\n* fix(config): bound @ref chain resolution (root cause: unbounded loop) — Fixes #382 by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/414\n* fix(cli): narrow error contract with structured CommandErrorKind (root cause: only CommandException caught) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/413\n* fix(cli): strict bool flags, POSIX -- separator, combined shorts and --no- negation by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/416\n* cli: add did-you-mean suggestions at dead-ends (Fixes #371) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/415\n* fix(cli): secret redaction in help and errors (Closes #383) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/419\n* perf(cli): cache command reflection descriptors with per-run reassembly by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/418\n* feat(cli): per-command service scope with property injection by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/420\n* feat(cli): centralize scalar type conversion with collection pipeline by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/417\n* chore(skills): install mattpocock + pstack skills by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/422\n* feat(cli): shell completion (Fixes #384) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/424\n* fix(cli): host-wins-canceled invokes Exiting callbacks exactly once (Fixes #400) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/421\n* fix(cli): S1 AOT hardening — walk-dedup, trim gates, CollectionShape fix (Fixes #369) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/427\n* fix(cli): thread isSecret into CollectionMaterialization (Fixes #426) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/428\n* Bump AbsolutePathHelpers from 0.3.143 to 0.3.144 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/429\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260910103052.b60105b...build.20260914103100.469fc1e",
